{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997280/extras/ab259144fd3ab8873bc9fc2562e07e1a.poster.avif?t=1766834945\" width=800 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997280/extras/ab259144fd3ab8873bc9fc2562e07e1a.webm?t=1766834945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997280/extras/ab259144fd3ab8873bc9fc2562e07e1a.mp4?t=1766834945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sticky Feet is a perspective-bending action horror with a rich story about grit, where you play as a lizard trapped in a decaying bayou trailer. Every surface is climbable, but nothing guarantees escape. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997280/extras/9d278f5f47a5983be88cfd9fdebae7fd.poster.avif?t=1766834945\" width=800 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997280/extras/9d278f5f47a5983be88cfd9fdebae7fd.webm?t=1766834945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997280/extras/9d278f5f47a5983be88cfd9fdebae7fd.mp4?t=1766834945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grandma is always there. She adapts to your hiding places, hounds you with a nailgun, and bears down with a presence you can\u2019t escape. All you are is small, fragile, and sticky.\u00a0 <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997280/extras/1ce0ab50b551ee92b1315b86d3ec29f8.poster.avif?t=1766834945\" width=796 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997280/extras/1ce0ab50b551ee92b1315b86d3ec29f8.webm?t=1766834945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997280/extras/1ce0ab50b551ee92b1315b86d3ec29f8.mp4?t=1766834945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get caught.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb walls, ceilings, and every rotten surface in sight as a lizard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outwit grandma who learns your tricks and hunts you down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure her constant, suffocating presence whether she sees you or not.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro reverse power fantasy horror that holds a deep narrative about grit and friendship</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sticky Feet, you are the smallest thing in the house and the most hunted. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997280/extras/6f366953b31cf42943041a654fa2941d.poster.avif?t=1766834945\" width=800 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997280/extras/6f366953b31cf42943041a654fa2941d.webm?t=1766834945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997280/extras/6f366953b31cf42943041a654fa2941d.mp4?t=1766834945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997280?t=1766834945","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997280/480a3a352f4175fb497623a294a9e8d2bc23187c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766834945","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor